s/Problem 10\">10</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest\" title=\"UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest\"> All UNM-PNM Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017025027\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.022 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.039 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 170/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1897/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 100/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4144/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    9.459      1 Template:UNM-PNM_Math_Contest_box\n100.00%    9.459      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:13804:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017025027 and revision id 166960. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}